okoro", "word_count": 94, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 29.875, "size_bytes": 180144, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 94, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 25.175, "size_bytes": 152064, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 94, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 27.375, "size_bytes": 165168, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 94, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@d92c8fa/content/data/versions/801.json", "paragraphs": ["The new area is called Catuaí. It looks like Brazil. Players can grow coffee and bananas there. They can also keep alpacas and Brahman cows.", "The add-on brings more than 25 new machines. Two new brands join the game: Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders. The game is on PS5, Xbox, PC and Mac.", "Players can buy the add-on alone. They can also buy the Year 2 Season Pass. A special edition with the main game is out now too."], "paragraphs_zh": ["新区域叫卡杜艾，风景很像巴西。玩家可以在那里种咖啡和香蕉，还能养羊驼和婆罗门牛。", "这个扩展包带来25种以上新农机，还有两个新品牌加入：Colombo Industries和Southern Spreaders。游戏登陆PS5、Xbox、PC和Mac平台。", "玩家可以单独购买扩展包，也可以买第二年季票。包含游戏正篇的特别版现在也已发售。"], "body": "The new area is called Catuaí. It looks like Brazil. Players can grow coffee and bananas there. They can also keep alpacas and Brahman cows.\n\nThe add-on brings more than 25 new machines. Two new brands join the game: Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders. The game is on PS5, Xbox, PC and Mac.\n\nPlayers can buy the add-on alone. They can also buy the Year 2 Season Pass. A special edition with the main game is out now too.", "body_zh": "新区域叫卡杜艾，风景很像巴西。玩家可以在那里种咖啡和香蕉，还能养羊驼和婆罗门牛。\n\n这个扩展包带来25种以上新农机，还有两个新品牌加入：Colombo Industries和Southern Spreaders。游戏登陆PS5、Xbox、PC和Mac平台。\n\n玩家可以单独购买扩展包，也可以买第二年季票。包含游戏正篇的特别版现在也已发售。", "text": "The new area is called Catuaí. It looks like Brazil. Players can grow coffee and bananas there. They can also keep alpacas and Brahman cows. The add-on brings more than 25 new machines. Two new brands join the game: Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders. The game is on PS5, Xbox, PC and Mac. Players can buy the add-on alone. They can also buy the Year 2 Season Pass. A special edition with the main game is out now too.", "vocab": [{"word": "add-on", "pos": "noun", "zh": "扩展包", "note": "游戏里的额外内容", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "farm", "pos": "verb", "zh": "务农；经营农场", "note": "也可作名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "grow", "pos": "verb", "zh": "种植", "note": "grow coffee 种咖啡", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "coffee", "pos": "noun", "zh": "咖啡", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "banana", "pos": "noun", "zh": "香蕉", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "machine", "pos": "noun", "zh": "机器；农机", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "brand", "pos": "noun", "zh": "品牌", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "buy", "pos": "verb", "zh": "购买", "note": "过去式 bought", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-29T01:10:10.588590", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "sm": 275, "em": 349, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "new", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.525, "sm": 350, "em": 524, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "area", "s": 0.525, "e": 0.875, "sm": 525, "em": 875, "cs": 8, "ce": 12, 